# "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature or enchantment or pay {2}" (CR 601.2b, 118.8). Bot1 sacrifices
# its Fastbond (an enchantment) and so pays only {1}{R} (Mox Ruby and Mox Emerald), and aims "5 damage to target creature" at its own
# Ornithopter, which would die and is exiled instead (CR 614.1a): it never reaches the graveyard. A Mox (an artifact, not a creature
# or an enchantment) is not a legal sacrifice.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Fastbond
Ornithopter
Betrayer's Bargain
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fastbond.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Betrayer's Bargain.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Modes(Sacrifice a creature or enchantment)
! Bot1.Choose(Mox Ruby)
Bot1.Choose(Fastbond)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Betrayer's Bargain; Fastbond
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Emerald
